{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And I will restore your judges.</b> The meaning is that Israel and their judges will go into exile, and He will remove the judges of Ahaz, and Hezekiah will establish judges of justice, for so it is written:" "<b>As at the first.</b> Like the days of David and Solomon, and the bet is superfluous:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:29.202310544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}